gate#theGateCompletesTheChangeBeforeTheGate| that diff before the gate — that is the order this run uses, because a finding a reader can make from the diff alone
gate#theGateCompletesTheChangeBeforeTheGate| must not cost a gate and then a second full pass (issue #758).
